      "q": "Who is the largest federal contractor in FY2026?",
      "a": "OPTUM PUBLIC SECTOR SOLUTIONS, INC. is the largest federal contractor in FY2026, with $19.9B in obligations. OPTUM PUBLIC SECTOR SOLUTIONS, INC. leads the published ranking of contractors for FY2026 to date."
